OL,3,GNEWSA'Harmful status quo meant my Mum
OL,4,Adied alone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bristol MP who has spoken out in
OL,7,Fsupport of the assisted dying bill said
OL,8,Fthe current "harmful status quo" led to
OL,9,Fher mother dying alone.
OL,11,FClaire Hazelgrove, the Labour MP for
OL,12,FFilton and Bradley Stoke, spoke about
OL,13,Fthe experience publicly for the first
OL,14,Ftime on Friday as the bill returned to
OL,15,Fthe Commons.
OL,17,FShe said her mother Ruth "chose to
OL,18,Fbring her late-stage terminal illness
OL,19,Fto an end on her terms at home, with
OL,20,Fdignity" last year at the age of 61.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
